# Pinned/fixture data whose exact bytes matter for security verification
# (PGP signatures, checksums) must never be line-ending-normalized —
# a CRLF/LF conversion on checkout wouldn't break parsing, but there's no
# reason to risk it for files this security-sensitive.
crates/nk-verify/pinned-keys/** -text
crates/nk-verify/test-fixtures/** -text
